      "id": "core.heroic-intervention"
    },
    "summary": "Use as the opponent's Charge phase ends on one of your **unengaged** units that is within 12″ of an enemy unit; a **VEHICLE** must also be a **CHARACTER** or **WALKER**. It resolves a charge ([Charge Step](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step)), and when you pay, before the **charge roll**, you pick one mode:\n\n- **Leap to Defend** (1 CP): only enemies that ended a **charge move** in this phase and are in reach can be charge targets.\n- **Into the Fray** (2 CP): a charge roll above 6 after modifiers counts as 6, and any enemy unit up to 6″ away and in reach can be a target.\n\nCP modifiers apply to the chosen mode's full starting cost.",
